  "content": "\n\n<h1>增強提示框</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/5eadf722db0fba952eadb08b8645c186c41e1507.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"200px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfKjjhv3pn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-Server-#00AF5C?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=#fff&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/UltimatChamp/enhancedtooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/On-GitHub-#0D1117?style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenhancedtooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/On-Modrinth-#00AF5C?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhancedtooltips\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/On-CurseForge-#f16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252foptimum-fuse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modpack-#00AF5C?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=my\" alt=\"Modpack\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>一款全面重製提示框並增添額外資訊的模組。</em></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h3>高度可自訂</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3>動畫提示框</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示框彈出動畫</strong></li>\n<li><strong>物品預覽彈跳動畫</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h3>食物提示框</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/93c4d6db03ac21c321dfc1af32b9ec4f530a3084.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>裝備提示框</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/969cc61c5e6d41181a20649914162fd353a13237.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>桶裝生物提示框</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/db148353cb482eb4410d398762a797b4c48d2be3.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>生成蛋預覽</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/907483cb4d4efe7172e050646d93dea75fa36fa5.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>提示框徽章</h3>\n<p><em>（若非原版物品則顯示模組名稱）</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/f138c81c5625ca5e92fa802afe4033cb9534f8be.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"500px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>地圖提示框預覽</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3>畫作提示框預覽</h3>\n<hr>\n<h3>耐久度提示框</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/195d97363aa2ca8b66be3936ef580734ed21af2c.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"150px\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/9137a384302024e24dbc6f63afdf98a2499f0148.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"125px\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/3cf4b9b18d9c7002f0a8e7a7c61b5c97bfcf7d59.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"175px\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>自訂顏色</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8H6RXl2q/images/df9ea34143aa6e23605976a9e18690dc8c3b7b97.png\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"300px\"></p>\n<h2>致謝名單！</h2>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-tooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Immersive:Tooltip</strong></a></h3>",
